00:02:29.649 --> 00:02:33.153
my decision, my shortsightedness.

00:02:33.153 --> 00:02:34.187
So here's the backstory.

00:02:34.187 --> 00:02:35.822
This all started in December

00:02:35.822 --> 00:02:36.756
when Marissa Hughes

00:02:36.756 --> 00:02:38.892
and her partner decided to adopt a baby

00:02:38.892 --> 00:02:40.560
